MYNTRA SALES & PRODUCT DASHBOARD (POWER BI)
=============================================

Data as of : 03/11/2026
Tool       : Microsoft Power BI Desktop


1. PROJECT OVERVIEW
-------------------
This is an interactive, two-page Power BI dashboard built on Myntra order
and product data. It shows order volume, revenue, brand and category
performance, city-tier split, size-wise inventory, and order status.


