12. HOW TO USE
--------------
1. Open the .pbix file in Power BI Desktop.
2. Use the slicers on Page 1 to filter by Brand, Category and City Tier.
3. Click any chart element to cross-filter the rest of the page.
4. Use the left navigation bar to move between Page 1 and Page 2.


13. NOTES
---------
- The dataset has an order status of "Shipped" (there is no "Pending"
  status), so Shipped is shown on the Order Status chart.
- The category list in the data (for example Sneakers, School Shoes,
  Face Wash, Lipstick) is different from a typical fashion catalogue, so
  the charts show the real categories from the data.
